Subject: [PATCH 3/5] (be) add native stack debug HTTP action

NativeStackAction bridges GET /api/debug/native_stack to the common free
functions: parse query params, then collect -> resolve_dsos -> serialize. It
reads query_params() for query-string arguments and carries no per-variant code.
